Svit is an independent research implementation of an agent process runtime.

Notable dependencies include:

- mlua (MIT), Rust bindings used to embed Luau.
- Luau (MIT), the guest-language implementation developed by Roblox.
- serde and serde_json (MIT OR Apache-2.0), serialization libraries.
- sha2 (MIT OR Apache-2.0), SHA-256 implementation from RustCrypto.
- thiserror (MIT OR Apache-2.0), typed error derive support.

Complete dependency versions and sources are recorded in Cargo.lock. This
notice is informational; dependency license texts and upstream copyright
notices remain authoritative.
